## Employment Policies

### Employment Classification
- **Full-Time**: 40+ hours/week, eligible for all benefits
- **Part-Time**: 20-39 hours/week, eligible for limited benefits
- **Contract**: Project-based, not eligible for benefits
- **Intern**: Temporary, limited benefits

### Work Hours
- Standard hours: 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM local time
- Core collaboration hours: 10:00 AM - 3:00 PM local time
- Flexible scheduling available with manager approval

### Remote Work Policy
- Hybrid model: 2-3 days in office per week
- Fully remote positions available for select roles
- Home office stipend: $1,500 one-time setup
- Monthly internet/phone reimbursement: $100

### Performance Reviews
- Quarterly check-ins with manager
- Annual comprehensive review
- 360-degree feedback process
- Performance ratings: Exceeds, Meets, Developing, Below

