## Code of Conduct

### Professional Behavior
- Treat all colleagues with respect
- Maintain confidentiality of patient data
- Report conflicts of interest
- No harassment or discrimination

### HIPAA Compliance
- Complete annual HIPAA training
- Report any potential breaches immediately
- Never share PHI outside authorized systems
- Use encryption for all patient data

### Security Requirements
- Use company-issued devices for work
- Enable MFA on all accounts
- Report suspicious emails to security@medsync.health
- Lock screens when away from desk

